    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SYM Shepherd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sam the German Shepherd is exploring a construction site</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help him perform tasks in this fun &amp; challenging dog simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform ALL of the green highlighted tasks, some are harder to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a fellow dog somewhere on the construction site</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platforming at the top of the site</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is more info on what features and content a customer can expect to be included with their purchase of this Simulation/Platformer...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Activities get more challenging as You progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach the Dog to Eat,\u00a0Drink, and Drink to increase Your Score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If You find the fellow dog somewhere on the construction site, they can be Your Friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Platforming action at the top of the site gets more and more challenging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can You find the &quot;Easter Egg&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SYM Shepherd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sam the German Shepherd is exploring a construction site</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help him perform tasks in this fun &amp; challenging dog simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform ALL of the green highlighted tasks, some are harder to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a fellow dog somewhere on the construction site</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platforming at the top of the site</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is more info on what features and content a customer can expect to be included with their purchase of this Simulation/Platformer...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Activities get more challenging as You progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach the Dog to Eat,\u00a0Drink, and Drink to increase Your Score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If You find the fellow dog somewhere on the construction site, they can be Your Friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Platforming action at the top of the site gets more and more challenging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can You find the &quot;Easter Egg&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
